Most warlocks are seen with voidwalkers in classic WoW because voidwalkers are more visually intimidating and iconic, making them stand out in groups or while traveling. While succubus is often more practical for leveling and questing (with useful tools like stealth and threat reduction), voidwalkers are preferred for their appearance and strong threat-related abilities, which are more noticeable and memorable in public spaces. [end of text]


